The application maps temperature bands to duty cycles:

- below 30 C: fan state OFF;
- 30–59 C: 25%;
- 60–89 C: 50%;
- 90–119 C: 75%;
- 120 C and above: 100%.

This is discrete rule-based control, not closed-loop control theory.

